welcome = Zapovit passes your saved information to trusted people if you are unable to manage your data yourself. Missed activity confirmations start a review by your trusted contacts; release requires their confirmations and a waiting period. Use only synthetic test data in this build.
home = Main menu
plan-menu = My plan
settings = Settings
choose-language = Choose your interface language.
recovery-options = Access and recovery
recoverstop = Stop using a recovery key
create = Create a plan
created = Plan created. Save the recovery key that arrives separately, then confirm that you saved it.
checkin = Confirm activity
stop = STOP transmission
resume = Arm the plan
new-secret = New secret
participants = Trusted people
invite = Invite a person
confirm-person = Confirm this person
joined = Invitation accepted. The owner must confirm you.
participant-joined = Someone accepted your invitation. Open Trusted people to confirm their Telegram ID.
secrets = Secrets and status
saved = Encrypted and saved. Content is no longer available to the owner. Guardians must save their codes before this secret is armed.
secret-armed = All guardian codes were acknowledged. The secret is ready; arm the plan when you are ready.
recovery-key = Save this recovery key outside Telegram. It can stop the plan and transfer ownership. It cannot reveal saved content.
guardian-key = Save this guardian code outside Telegram. It is needed to confirm a future release request.
saved-delete = Saved — delete this message
manual-delete = Telegram could not delete the message. Please delete it manually from the chat.
checkin-reminder = Please use /checkin to confirm that you can manage your data yourself. A confirmation cancels pending release requests.
inactivity-detected = You have not confirmed activity within the configured period. Your trusted contacts have been asked to review whether you can manage your data yourself. Use /checkin or /stop to cancel transmission.
guardian-request = The owner has not confirmed activity within the configured period. Confirm only if, based on what you know, the owner is unable to manage their data themselves and you agree to release this secret. A missed confirmation alone does not establish this. Tap Submit code, then reply to the request with your saved code.
submit-code = Submit code
code-prompt = Reply to this message with your saved guardian code only if, based on what you know, the owner is unable to manage their data themselves and you agree to release this secret. The code confirms this request only.
code-accepted = Code accepted for this release request.
quorum-reached = The required guardians confirmed the release request. The waiting period has started. You can still cancel using /checkin or /stop.
case-expired = Guardian collection expired. A new request can be created after the cooldown.
cancel-vote-request = A guardian requested cancellation. Open /guardians to review and vote. Cancellation requires everyone's explicit vote.
vote-cancel = Vote to cancel
request-cancel = Request cancellation
done = Done
back = ← Back
text = Text
copyable = Copyable text
spoiler = Hidden text
file = File
block-prompt = Send the content for this block. For a file, send a document with an optional caption.
builder = Add text, a copyable block, hidden text or a file. When ready, select recipients and guardians.
choose-guardians = Select guardians, then Done.
choose-recipients = Select recipients, then Done.
choose-threshold = Select how many guardians must confirm.
choose-timing = Send three numbers in days: reminder interval, inactivity threshold and waiting period. Example: 7 28 7. Inactivity must be at least twice the reminder interval.
preview = Preview the draft
save = Save and encrypt
draft-ready = Review the draft and its selected people. After Save, you cannot read or change its content or access rules.
stopped = Transmission is stopped. Previously delivered copies cannot be recalled. Explicitly arm the plan to resume.
checked-in = Activity confirmed. Pending transmission is cancelled. A stopped plan remains stopped until explicitly armed.
armed = Plan armed. Remember to confirm activity.
delete = Delete permanently
delete-confirm = Permanently delete this plan and its saved data? Copies already received by people cannot be recalled.
deleted = Deletion requested. Transmission is blocked and stored objects will be removed.
recover = Recover access
recovery-prompt = Send your recovery key. Use /recoverstop to stop without transferring ownership, or /recover to transfer management to this Telegram account.
recovery-pending = The plan is paused. Save and acknowledge your new recovery key to finish the transfer.
recovered = Access restored. The plan remains stopped. Previously saved content cannot be read.
error = This action could not be completed. Check the plan status before trying again.
invalid-input = The input is invalid or this step has expired. Return to /start.
rate-limited = Too many attempts. Please wait before trying again. STOP and activity confirmation remain available.
status = Status
language = Language
guardians = Guardian requests
no-items = No items available.
file-received = File queued for encrypted storage. Wait for the saved-block confirmation before continuing.
block-saved = Block added to the draft.
confirmed = Confirmed.
awaiting-file = File storage is still in progress. Please wait.
needs-attention = Delivery needs attention. An uncertain result will not be retried automatically.
rotate-recovery = Replace recovery key
resend-code = Send my code again
retry-delivery = Request delivery retry
retry-warning = Telegram may already have delivered this part. Retrying can create a duplicate. Request another attempt only if you need it.
retry-confirmed = I understand — retry
guardians-label = Guardians (Telegram IDs)
recipients-label = Recipients (Telegram IDs)
threshold-label = Required confirmations
timing-label = Days: reminders / inactivity / waiting
delete-confirmed = Yes, delete permanently
outage-hold = Service interruption detected. Transmission is on hold for a full waiting period. Confirm your activity if you are available.
state-setup = Setup
state-active = Active
state-paused = Stopped
state-deletion-pending = Deleting
state-deleted = Deleted
state-provisioning = Waiting for saved-code confirmations
state-armed = Ready
state-setup-failed = Setup expired
state-partial = Partially delivered
state-needs-attention = Needs attention
state-delivered = Delivered
draft-reset = Your unfinished draft was closed when the service restarted. Create a new draft to continue. Your saved secrets are still stored.
